# Used instead of the root .dockerignore when building tools/generator/Dockerfile.
# The context is the repository root; only the generator's source and the
# template docs it reads at run time go in.
*
!tools/generator/go.mod
!tools/generator/go.sum
!tools/generator/cmd/
!tools/generator/internal/
tools/generator/internal/it/
!docs/teaching-guidelines.md
!docs/html-output-contract.md
!docs/lesson-template.md
!docs/quiz-guidelines.md
